:49:16", "end": "00:49:47", "text": "I'm not sure how long we'll keep it rolling for, but we're having fun. This one here, Formidable Force. It's Mind Games and it's the Bretts He Said She Said Mix. Text in if you're still tuned in. The number is 0435123945."}, {"start": "00:55:52", "end": "00:56:17", "text": "This one here is Derek Carr, Destiny. As requested by Nemo. As requested by Nemo. Normally you don't do track IDs, but... Track IDs, track requests. Track requests, yeah, sorry, we do... Only if it's good. We do heaps of track IDs. There's only track IDs on the program page. You can go look at all of the tracks that we played."}, {"start": "01:36:03", "end": "01:36:24", "text": "You're like, it's really nice to make sure you look good. Your perfume's even cleaner if you can take the lead. I'd have to feature octopus that did this. Let's hope that I don't say. I'm a mess forever, but I don't see the weather. That was supposed to let me call it set up, set up. Text me by, last to Dubai. I don't know how to do it, you can teach me if you're nice."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:05:25"}, "track": {"title": "Casafied Modern Music (Deep Mix)", "artists": [{"name": "DJ Catt & DJ Foxx"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:06:00"}, "track": {"title": "Shanti", "artists": [{"name": "Solee"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:07:00"}, "track": {"title": "Fences", "artists": [{"name": "Primitive Needs"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:08:00"}, "track": {"title": "La Danza", "artists": [{"name": "Alan Dixon"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:10:00"}, "track": {"title": "Changes", "artists": [{"name": "EKDK & Apollo's Messengers"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enab